ctory.<name>` attributes for the patch-the-module consumers, and all value re-exports are unchanged; direct top-level `import traj_render` was never the declared seam (`import gen_trajectory` is), and the affected tests were migrated. The `specref_findings` hunk is from an earlier commit in the range against base `83f2c7aa`, not this slice, and its ruling is recorded in commit 1e78ada3 — not re-litigated. The single blocking finding is a membership/command omission with a two-line repair, reproducible from the slice's own data edit; everything else in scope is sound."},"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b410166c-4dfb-4c43-99dc-caf1f823b987"}
